    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/ea8f977952c2cc87f44546468393a75d.poster.avif?t=1740678012\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/ea8f977952c2cc87f44546468393a75d.webm?t=1740678012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/ea8f977952c2cc87f44546468393a75d.mp4?t=1740678012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Test your general knowledge and reasoning skills in \u201cWho Wants to Be a Millionaire?\u201d, the official video game of the show!<br>Experience the suspense of the famous TV show in the official video game Who Wants to Be a Millionaire? <br>Climb the prize ladder by answering 15 increasingly difficult questions. Is that your final answer? <br><br><strong>THOUSANDS OF QUESTIONS</strong><br><br>Over 6000 questions to test your general knowledge on more than 15 diverse topics: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Art &amp; Literature<br></li><li>Science<br></li><li>Geography<br></li><li>History<br></li><li>Entertainment<br></li><li>Star Wars<br></li><li>Harry Potter<br></li><li>Disney<br></li><li>Superheroes<br></li><li>Manga<br></li><li>TV series<br></li><li>Sports<br></li><li>Soccer<br></li><li>Language<br></li><li>Lifestyle<br></li><li>World food</li></ul><br>Music, lifelines, phone a friend, 50/50, suspense... it\u2019s all there! Relive the authentic atmosphere of the show! <br>United Kingdom, United States, Spain, Italy, Germany, and France... these 6 countries each have exclusive questions available in players\u2019 native languages.<br>Select your favorite topics and practice in personalized sessions to enhance your general knowledge and improve your chances of winning the jackpot! Unlock question packs by accumulating \u201cNeurons\u201d as you play.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/1b84a8053909462b8f4187bf50d77e41.poster.avif?t=1740678012\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/1b84a8053909462b8f4187bf50d77e41.webm?t=1740678012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/1b84a8053909462b8f4187bf50d77e41.mp4?t=1740678012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>FOR THE WHOLE FAMILY!</strong><br>The game includes \u201cEASY\u201d mode so players of all ages can have fun.<br>There is also a \u201cFAMILY MODE\u201d  which tailors questions to each player based on age.<br>In \u201cTAKING TURNS\u201d mode, compete against up to 9 other players, sharing the controller. If you make a mistake, you\u2019re eliminated, and the last one standing is the champion!<br><br>In \u201cFREE-FOR-ALL\u201d mode, it\u2019s a race for points with up to 4 players. Building a streak of correct answers earns extra points and brings you closer to victory!<br><br><strong>COMPETE WITH PLAYERS FROM AROUND THE WORLD IN ONLINE MULTIPLAYER MODE</strong><br>In \u201cONLINE MULTIPLAYER\u201d mode, you can play up to 50 players online!<br>In this Battle Royale, players can face up to 49 opponents with direct elimination: answer the questions correctly as quickly as possible to finish in first place and become the champion!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/7fa4274999189de9571f26c9083badbb.avif?t=1740678012\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/ea8f977952c2cc87f44546468393a75d.poster.avif?t=1740678012\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/ea8f977952c2cc87f44546468393a75d.webm?t=1740678012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/ea8f977952c2cc87f44546468393a75d.mp4?t=1740678012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Test your general knowledge and reasoning skills in \u201cWho Wants to Be a Millionaire?\u201d, the official video game of the show!<br>Experience the suspense of the famous TV show in the official video game Who Wants to Be a Millionaire? <br>Climb the prize ladder by answering 15 increasingly difficult questions. Is that your final answer? <br><br><strong>THOUSANDS OF QUESTIONS</strong><br><br>Over 6000 questions to test your general knowledge on more than 15 diverse topics: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Art &amp; Literature<br></li><li>Science<br></li><li>Geography<br></li><li>History<br></li><li>Entertainment<br></li><li>Star Wars<br></li><li>Harry Potter<br></li><li>Disney<br></li><li>Superheroes<br></li><li>Manga<br></li><li>TV series<br></li><li>Sports<br></li><li>Soccer<br></li><li>Language<br></li><li>Lifestyle<br></li><li>World food</li></ul><br>Music, lifelines, phone a friend, 50/50, suspense... it\u2019s all there! Relive the authentic atmosphere of the show! <br>United Kingdom, United States, Spain, Italy, Germany, and France... these 6 countries each have exclusive questions available in players\u2019 native languages.<br>Select your favorite topics and practice in personalized sessions to enhance your general knowledge and improve your chances of winning the jackpot! Unlock question packs by accumulating \u201cNeurons\u201d as you play.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/1b84a8053909462b8f4187bf50d77e41.poster.avif?t=1740678012\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/1b84a8053909462b8f4187bf50d77e41.webm?t=1740678012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/1b84a8053909462b8f4187bf50d77e41.mp4?t=1740678012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>FOR THE WHOLE FAMILY!</strong><br>The game includes \u201cEASY\u201d mode so players of all ages can have fun.<br>There is also a \u201cFAMILY MODE\u201d  which tailors questions to each player based on age.<br>In \u201cTAKING TURNS\u201d mode, compete against up to 9 other players, sharing the controller. If you make a mistake, you\u2019re eliminated, and the last one standing is the champion!<br><br>In \u201cFREE-FOR-ALL\u201d mode, it\u2019s a race for points with up to 4 players. Building a streak of correct answers earns extra points and brings you closer to victory!<br><br><strong>COMPETE WITH PLAYERS FROM AROUND THE WORLD IN ONLINE MULTIPLAYER MODE</strong><br>In \u201cONLINE MULTIPLAYER\u201d mode, you can play up to 50 players online!<br>In this Battle Royale, players can face up to 49 opponents with direct elimination: answer the questions correctly as quickly as possible to finish in first place and become the champion!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356240/extras/7fa4274999189de9571f26c9083badbb.avif?t=1740678012\" /></div>",
